    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "2e7042f401e5ddb5ec8c": "Nice to see a friendly face. I don't get much chitchat from Apothecary Johaan unless he wants something. He's been out of the grave too long. Someday I'll be like that, I hear. Creepy. Maybe by then I won't care.",
        "356f3e850dc2ded7f922": "I appreciate the company, but let's face it: you have more experience with potions than I do. Talk to Doctor Marsh instead if you want training. He's a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.",
        "6be72091009d5fcdf1ec": "Here to learn about potions? I've got plenty to teach you. I might be dead, but I haven't lost my brains. Yet.",
        "7280de14582e4c213561": "Train me."
      },
      "name": "Carolai Anise",
      "subName": "Journeyman Alchemist",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.2e7042f401e5ddb5ec8c": {
